 {
  "id": 21,
  "platform": "NES",
  "game": "DuckTales",
  "target": "The Moon Base",
  "url": "https://strategywiki.org/wiki/DuckTales/Walkthrough",
  "section_count": 8,
  "description": "The Moon Base, DuckTales (NES). Alternatively, it can quickly run briefly across the floor. Although it moves very quickly, this boss is relatively easy to defeat. It usually quickly jumps from the center of the room to the two suspended platforms on the left and right, and vice versa.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'The Moon Base' from DuckTales (NES). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: The Moon Base, DuckTales (NES). Alternatively, it can quickly run briefly across the floor. Although it moves very quickly, this boss is relatively easy to defeat. It usually quickly jumps from the center of the room to the two suspended platforms on the left and right, and vice versa. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "Although it moves very quickly, this boss is relatively easy to defeat. It usually quickly jumps from the center of the room to the two suspended platforms on the left and right, and vice versa. Alternatively, it can quickly run briefly across the floor. A good way to defeat the Moon Rat is to stay on one of the two raised platforms and pogo-jump continuously. This way, you can easily avoid the boss's attacks and attack it whenever you get a chance, or even when it pauses for a moment in the center of the room. Keep in mind, however, that after being attacked, the Moon Rat will flash for a few moments. During this time, don't attack it, as it won't help; in fact, you'll hurt yourself. Hit the boss five times to defeat it and find the Green Cheese of Longevity.",
  "brief": "The Moon Base, DuckTales (NES). Alternatively, it can quickly run briefly across the floor. Although it moves very quickly, this boss is relatively easy to defeat. It usually quickly jumps from the center of the room to the two suspended platforms on the left and right, and vice versa.",
  "page_title": "DuckTales/The Moon",
  "image_url": "https://cdn.wikimg.net/en/strategywiki/images/4/40/DuckTales_Moon_Hidden_Treasure_Location.png",
  "image_kind": "screenshot",
  "image_urls": [
   "https://cdn.wikimg.net/en/strategywiki/images/4/40/DuckTales_Moon_Hidden_Treasure_Location.png"
  ],
  "image_kinds": [
   "screenshot"
  ]
 },
 {
  "id": 22,
  "platform": "NES",
