  "section_count": 5,
  "description": "Blobolonia, A Boy and His Blob (NES). The game consists of eighty levels (forty standard and an additional forty hidden challenge levels) with the standard levels consisting of an average of ten hours of gameplay. A Boy and His Blobis aplatformvideo game developed byWayForward Technologiesand published byMajesco Entertainmentfor theWii. It was released in North America on October 13,2009and in Europe on November 6, 2009.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Blobolonia' from A Boy and His Blob (NES). World brief: Blobolonia, A Boy and His Blob (NES). The game consists of eighty levels (forty standard and an additional forty hidden challenge levels) with the standard levels consisting of an average of ten hours of gameplay. A Boy and His Blobis aplatformvideo game developed byWayForward Technologiesand published byMajesco Entertainmentfor theWii. It was released in North America on October 13,2009and in Europe on November 6, 2009. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "A Boy and His Blobis aplatformvideo game developed byWayForward Technologiesand published byMajesco Entertainmentfor theWii. It was released in North America on October 13,2009and in Europe on November 6, 2009. The gameplay is very similar tothe original game. The protagonist feeds the titular blob jelly beans to transform him into one of fifteen different objects that can be used to solve puzzles and defeat enemies. The game consists of eighty levels (forty standard and an additional forty hidden challenge levels) with the standard levels consisting of an average of ten hours of gameplay. A Boy and His Blob does not take advantage of the Wii Remote's motion detection or IR controls.",
  "brief": "Blobolonia, A Boy and His Blob (NES). The game consists of eighty levels (forty standard and an additional forty hidden challenge levels) with the standard levels consisting of an average of ten hours of gameplay. A Boy and His Blobis aplatformvideo game developed byWayForward Technologiesand published byMajesco Entertainmentfor theWii. It was released in North America on October 13,2009and in Europe on November 6, 2009.",
  "page_title": "A Boy and His Blob"
 },
