  "description": "Magitek Research Facility, Final Fantasy VI (SNES). Final Fantasy VIis a game in theFinal Fantasyseries. At the time, three of the five preceding games in the series had not been released in the US, so it was released in the U.S. asFinal Fantasy III.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Magitek Research Facility' from Final Fantasy VI (SNES). The attached reference image is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Magitek Research Facility, Final Fantasy VI (SNES). Final Fantasy VIis a game in theFinal Fantasyseries. At the time, three of the five preceding games in the series had not been released in the US, so it was released in the U.S. asFinal Fantasy III. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "Final Fantasy VIis a game in theFinal Fantasyseries. At the time, three of the five preceding games in the series had not been released in the US, so it was released in the U.S. asFinal Fantasy III. With the release ofFinal Fantasy Anthologyit has been correctly renumbered as the sixth game for all regions. One of the most notable and identifying elements within the game is the presence of powerful beings calledEspers.",
