  "section_count": 2,
  "description": "Mine Cart Carnage, Donkey Kong Country (SNES). Walk ahead and jump over the blast barrel. And this may sound like killing yourself but it works.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Mine Cart Carnage' from Donkey Kong Country (SNES). The attached reference image is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Mine Cart Carnage, Donkey Kong Country (SNES). Walk ahead and jump over the blast barrel. And this may sound like killing yourself but it works. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "Walk ahead and jump over the blast barrel. And this may sound like killing yourself but it works. There is a barrel at the bottom and that barrel will blast you to the end. Make sure you get Donkey Kong or Diddy Kong in case you get hit. If you get hit use your remaining player and jump into the cart. Get ready to jump because there is a Krash waiting for you to jump over it. Then you will see the exit!",
