  "section_count": 4,
  "description": "Rotating Stone Room, Super Castlevania IV (SNES). The world is much more expansive, taking place both inside the castle and in the surrounding countryside. \"Devil's Castle Dracula\")is the 4th version of thefirstCastlevania, and the 8th game in the series; it is also the 6thCastlevaniagame released on aNintendoconsole. Super Castlevania IV(悪魔城ドラキュラ,Akumajō Dorakula?, lit.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Rotating Stone Room' from Super Castlevania IV (SNES). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Rotating Stone Room, Super Castlevania IV (SNES). The world is much more expansive, taking place both inside the castle and in the surrounding countryside. \"Devil's Castle Dracula\")is the 4th version of thefirstCastlevania, and the 8th game in the series; it is also the 6thCastlevaniagame released on aNintendoconsole. Super Castlevania IV(悪魔城ドラキュラ,Akumajō Dorakula?, lit. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "Super Castlevania IV(悪魔城ドラキュラ,Akumajō Dorakula?, lit. \"Devil's Castle Dracula\")is the 4th version of thefirstCastlevania, and the 8th game in the series; it is also the 6thCastlevaniagame released on aNintendoconsole. In fact, the original Japanese title lacks any numbering. It was the first Castlevania to be released on theSuper Nintendo, and is often considered to be a showcase of the console's capabilities. The game was intended to be a remake of theoriginal Castlevania, however the level design, graphics, music, and gameplay have been completely overhauled. The world is much more expansive, taking place both inside the castle and in the surrounding countryside.",
  "brief": "Rotating Stone Room, Super Castlevania IV (SNES). The world is much more expansive, taking place both inside the castle and in the surrounding countryside. \"Devil's Castle Dracula\")is the 4th version of thefirstCastlevania, and the 8th game in the series; it is also the 6thCastlevaniagame released on aNintendoconsole. Super Castlevania IV(悪魔城ドラキュラ,Akumajō Dorakula?, lit.",
