  "description": "Mute City Anti-Gravity Track, F-Zero (SNES). This is the first game in theF-Zeroseries. For other games in the series see theF-Zero category. F-Zero(エフゼロ,Efu Zero?)is a genre-definingracinggame for theSNESand was one of the system's original launch titles.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Mute City Anti-Gravity Track' from F-Zero (SNES). The attached reference image is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Mute City Anti-Gravity Track, F-Zero (SNES). This is the first game in theF-Zeroseries. For other games in the series see theF-Zero category. F-Zero(エフゼロ,Efu Zero?)is a genre-definingracinggame for theSNESand was one of the system's original launch titles. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "This is the first game in theF-Zeroseries. For other games in the series see theF-Zero category. F-Zero(エフゼロ,Efu Zero?)is a genre-definingracinggame for theSNESand was one of the system's original launch titles. The game was originally released in cartridge format for the console but was later made available throughNintendo's digital distribution channels on the Super Famicom (SatellaviewandNintendo Power). In2006, an emulated version was released for theWii Virtual Console. That version was re-released for theWii U Virtual Consolevia theNintendo eShopin2013. The game was originally released to rave reviews from critics, praising its emphasis on racing with finesse, its soundtrack and its superb graphical quality. Using Nintendo's \"Mode 7\" display mode, F-Zero could scale and rotate large bitmapped tilesets to produce the illusion of 3D without the need to render even a single polygon.",
  "brief": "Mute City Anti-Gravity Track, F-Zero (SNES). This is the first game in theF-Zeroseries. For other games in the series see theF-Zero category. F-Zero(エフゼロ,Efu Zero?)is a genre-definingracinggame for theSNESand was one of the system's original launch titles.",
  "page_title": "F-Zero",
  "image_url": null,
  "image_kind": null
 },
