  "section_count": 1,
  "description": "Rain-Slicked Downtown, Streets of Rage 2 (Genesis). It features new music by Yuzo Koshiro (inspired by early '90s club music). It features better graphics, more moves, and longer stages than ever before. Streets of Rage 2, known asBare Knuckle II(ベア・ナックルII 死闘への鎮魂歌,Bare Knuckle II?)in Japan andStreets of Rage IIin Europe, is a side-scrollingbeat 'em upfirst released bySegain1993, and is the sequel to the popularStreets of Rage.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Rain-Slicked Downtown' from Streets of Rage 2 (Genesis). The attached reference image is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Rain-Slicked Downtown, Streets of Rage 2 (Genesis). It features new music by Yuzo Koshiro (inspired by early '90s club music). It features better graphics, more moves, and longer stages than ever before. Streets of Rage 2, known asBare Knuckle II(ベア・ナックルII 死闘への鎮魂歌,Bare Knuckle II?)in Japan andStreets of Rage IIin Europe, is a side-scrollingbeat 'em upfirst released bySegain1993, and is the sequel to the popularStreets of Rage. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "Streets of Rage 2, known asBare Knuckle II(ベア・ナックルII 死闘への鎮魂歌,Bare Knuckle II?)in Japan andStreets of Rage IIin Europe, is a side-scrollingbeat 'em upfirst released bySegain1993, and is the sequel to the popularStreets of Rage. It features new music by Yuzo Koshiro (inspired by early '90s club music). It features better graphics, more moves, and longer stages than ever before. The cast of playable characters is also expanded: Adam is no longer available but his place is taken by Skate and Max, raising the roster to four. It was followed by a sequel calledStreets of Rage 3. The game's immense popularity led to its inclusion in various compilations, includingSega Smash Pack Volume 1for theSega DreamcastandSonic Gems CollectionforNintendo GameCube,PlayStation 2(Japan only).",
  "brief": "Rain-Slicked Downtown, Streets of Rage 2 (Genesis). It features new music by Yuzo Koshiro (inspired by early '90s club music). It features better graphics, more moves, and longer stages than ever before. Streets of Rage 2, known asBare Knuckle II(ベア・ナックルII 死闘への鎮魂歌,Bare Knuckle II?)in Japan andStreets of Rage IIin Europe, is a side-scrollingbeat 'em upfirst released bySegain1993, and is the sequel to the popularStreets of Rage.",
