  "description_raw": "Beyond Oasis(The Story of ThorandThe Story of Thor: A Successor of The Lightin Europe and Japan, respectively) is anaction-adventurereleased for theSega Genesisin1994. The game was followed by a prequel, released in1996for theSega Saturn, titledLegend of Oasis. Beyond Oasis was included in the2009compilation titledSonic's Ultimate Genesis Collection, which included oneachievement, the ability to save the game anywhere, the ability to enable rapid fire, and button mappings for the item menu, weapon menu, and map.",
