  "description_raw": "This is the first game in theToeJam & Earlseries. For other games in the series see theToeJam & Earl category. ToeJam & Earlis the first in a series ofaction-adventuregames for theSega GenesisandXboxconsoles. The first game was released on March 12,1991in North America. The games feature the two eponymous characters, aliens from a planet called Funkotron, who accidentally crash on Earth after their ship collides with an asteroid. The games were created byToeJam & Earl Productions, formerly known as Johnson Voorsanger Productions (JVP), of San Rafael, California by founders Greg Johnson and Mark Voorsanger. Scott Berfield was the producer and it was published bySega of America. The music was written by John Baker.",
