 {
  "id": 82,
  "platform": "Genesis",
  "game": "Ecco the Dolphin",
  "target": "Open Ocean & Sunken Temples",
  "url": "https://strategywiki.org/wiki/Ecco_the_Dolphin/Walkthrough",
  "section_count": 1,
  "description": "Open Ocean & Sunken Temples, Ecco the Dolphin (Genesis). As the name suggests, Ecco finds himself in the open ocean, surrounded by sharks. At first, this level will seem scary, but it's actually fairly straightforward. The objective of this level is simply to get to the far right side of the map without becoming dolphin steak.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Open Ocean & Sunken Temples' from Ecco the Dolphin (Genesis). World brief: Open Ocean & Sunken Temples, Ecco the Dolphin (Genesis). As the name suggests, Ecco finds himself in the open ocean, surrounded by sharks. At first, this level will seem scary, but it's actually fairly straightforward. The objective of this level is simply to get to the far right side of the map without becoming dolphin steak. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "At first, this level will seem scary, but it's actually fairly straightforward. As the name suggests, Ecco finds himself in the open ocean, surrounded by sharks. The objective of this level is simply to get to the far right side of the map without becoming dolphin steak. To do this, you'll need to dive down into the depths and dash forwards along the bottom of the stage. This way, you'll kill any sharks in your path, taking little or no damage. The main danger is surfacing for air, since you may surface into a particularly shark-infested area. My advice is to keep dashing, spending as little time as possible above the bottom of the stage. It may take a few attempts to get it right, but you should eventually make your way to the far edge, and the next level.",
  "brief": "Open Ocean & Sunken Temples, Ecco the Dolphin (Genesis). As the name suggests, Ecco finds himself in the open ocean, surrounded by sharks. At first, this level will seem scary, but it's actually fairly straightforward. The objective of this level is simply to get to the far right side of the map without becoming dolphin steak.",
  "page_title": "Ecco the Dolphin/Open Ocean"
 },
