  "description": "Mt. Eternal, Alex Kidd in Miracle World (Master System). This is the first game in theAlex Kiddseries. For other games in the series see theAlex Kidd category. Alex Kidd in Miracle World(アレックスキッドのミラクルワールド,Arekkusu Kiddo no Mirakuru Wārudo?)is aplatformvideo game for theMaster System.",
