  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Camineet Spaceport City' from Phantasy Star (Master System). World brief: Camineet Spaceport City, Phantasy Star (Master System). A vivid classic environment representing Camineet Spaceport City from Phantasy Star. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "In the building in the northeast corner, you can collect 50 mesetas. Follow the left-hand wall to reach the chest. There is also a place to recover health to the southwest of your home. You can also learn about the Algol star system and the three planets, Palma, Motavia, and Dezoris. You can learn from nearby buildings of a fighter named Odin in a town called Scion, and a Laconian pot that can assist you.",
