  "description": "Cave of Monsters, Bubble Bobble (Arcade). Bubble Bobble(バブルボブル,Baburu Boburu?)is anarcadegame byTaito, first released in1986and later ported to numerous home computers and game consoles. The popularity ofBubble Bobbleled Taito (or its licensees) to port to many home computers and game consoles. This is the first game in theBubble Bobbleseries.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Cave of Monsters' from Bubble Bobble (Arcade). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Cave of Monsters, Bubble Bobble (Arcade). Bubble Bobble(バブルボブル,Baburu Boburu?)is anarcadegame byTaito, first released in1986and later ported to numerous home computers and game consoles. The popularity ofBubble Bobbleled Taito (or its licensees) to port to many home computers and game consoles. This is the first game in theBubble Bobbleseries. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "This is the first game in theBubble Bobbleseries. For other games in the series see theBubble Bobble category. Bubble Bobble(バブルボブル,Baburu Boburu?)is anarcadegame byTaito, first released in1986and later ported to numerous home computers and game consoles. The game, starring the twin Bubble DragonsBub(Bubblun)(バブルン,Baburun?)andBob(Bobblun)(ボブルン,Boburun?), is an action-platform game in which players travel through one hundred different stages, busting and pushing bubbles, avoiding enemies and collecting a variety of items. The game became very popular and led to a long series of sequels and spin-offs. The main goal of the game is to rescue Bub and Bob's girlfriends from monsters. It is also notable for being an early example of a game with multiple endings, which depended on the player's skill and discovering secrets. In the game, each player controls one of the two Bubble Dragons, Bub and",
  "brief": "Cave of Monsters, Bubble Bobble (Arcade). Bubble Bobble(バブルボブル,Baburu Boburu?)is anarcadegame byTaito, first released in1986and later ported to numerous home computers and game consoles. The popularity ofBubble Bobbleled Taito (or its licensees) to port to many home computers and game consoles. This is the first game in theBubble Bobbleseries.",
