  "description": "Green Wireframe Moonscape, Battlezone (Arcade). This is the first game in theBattlezoneseries. For other games in the series see theBattlezone category. Battlezoneis a first-personshooterarcade game which was released byAtariin1980; it utilizes one Motorola M6502 (running at 1.512 MHz), with a Pokey sound chip running at that same speed, and a custom DAC.",
