  "page_title": "Mega Man 4",
  "section_count": 1,
  "description": "Pharaoh Man's Sunken Tomb, Mega Man 4 (NES). Mega Man 4, known asRockman 4: A New Ambition!!(ロックマン 4 新たなる野望!!,Rokkuman Foo Arata Naru Yaboo!!?)(also translated asNew Evil AmbitionorNew Treachery) in Japan, is the fourth game in theMega Man series. Many years after its initial debut the game was re-released in Japan for thePlayStationas part of theRockman Complete Worksseries.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Pharaoh Man's Sunken Tomb' from Mega Man 4 (NES). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Pharaoh Man's Sunken Tomb, Mega Man 4 (NES). Mega Man 4, known asRockman 4: A New Ambition!!(ロックマン 4 新たなる野望!!,Rokkuman Foo Arata Naru Yaboo!!?)(also translated asNew Evil AmbitionorNew Treachery) in Japan, is the fourth game in theMega Man series. Many years after its initial debut the game was re-released in Japan for thePlayStationas part of theRockman Complete Worksseries. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "Mega Man 4, known asRockman 4: A New Ambition!!(ロックマン 4 新たなる野望!!,Rokkuman Foo Arata Naru Yaboo!!?)(also translated asNew Evil AmbitionorNew Treachery) in Japan, is the fourth game in theMega Man series. Many years after its initial debut the game was re-released in Japan for thePlayStationas part of theRockman Complete Worksseries. Later, the game was bundled inMega Man Anniversary Collectionalong with the entire original series. The PlayStation re-release features improved graphics, additional controls, and unlockable parts that you can swap in and out to upgrade Mega Man with.",
  "brief": "Pharaoh Man's Sunken Tomb, Mega Man 4 (NES). Mega Man 4, known asRockman 4: A New Ambition!!(ロックマン 4 新たなる野望!!,Rokkuman Foo Arata Naru Yaboo!!?)(also translated asNew Evil AmbitionorNew Treachery) in Japan, is the fourth game in theMega Man series. Many years after its initial debut the game was re-released in Japan for thePlayStationas part of theRockman Complete Worksseries.",
