  "section_count": 1,
  "description": "Tomahawk Man's Canyon, Mega Man 6 (NES). Mega Man 6is the sixth Mega Man game in the series, and the last Mega Man game on theNES. The NES version was released only in Japan and the U.S. In 1999 the game was re-released for thePlayStationexclusively in Japan as part ofRockman Complete Works.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Tomahawk Man's Canyon' from Mega Man 6 (NES). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Tomahawk Man's Canyon, Mega Man 6 (NES). Mega Man 6is the sixth Mega Man game in the series, and the last Mega Man game on theNES. The NES version was released only in Japan and the U.S. In 1999 the game was re-released for thePlayStationexclusively in Japan as part ofRockman Complete Works. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "Mega Man 6is the sixth Mega Man game in the series, and the last Mega Man game on theNES. The NES version was released only in Japan and the U.S. In 1999 the game was re-released for thePlayStationexclusively in Japan as part ofRockman Complete Works. Five years later, in2004the game returned to sixth generation consoles bundled inMega Man Anniversary Collection. In2007it was released in Japan formobiledevices. In2012it was released for theNintendo 3DS Virtual Consolevia theNintendo eShop. In2014, the Nintendo eShop release was made available for theWii U Virtual Console.",
