  "section_count": 2,
  "description": "Wookie Hole & Turbo Tunnel, Battletoads (NES). This level is a deep downward trek to the bottom, with the toads slowly climbing down the hole by a rope. To execute it, move towards one of the walls and wait for the rope to follow.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Wookie Hole & Turbo Tunnel' from Battletoads (NES). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Wookie Hole & Turbo Tunnel, Battletoads (NES). This level is a deep downward trek to the bottom, with the toads slowly climbing down the hole by a rope. To execute it, move towards one of the walls and wait for the rope to follow. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "The level will automatically scroll downward as you progress. However, you will need to defeat all visible enemies, and the scrolling will stop as soon as an enemy reaches the top. You have the following enemies to worry about:",
  "brief": "Wookie Hole & Turbo Tunnel, Battletoads (NES). This level is a deep downward trek to the bottom, with the toads slowly climbing down the hole by a rope. To execute it, move towards one of the walls and wait for the rope to follow.",
