  "description_raw": "Adventure Island II(高橋名人の冒険島Ⅱ,Takahashi Meijin no Bōken Jima Tsū?, lit. \"Master Takahashi's Adventure Island II\")is a platform game released byHudson Softin February1991. It was first released for theNES, and ported to theGame Boyunder the nameAdventure Island. The Game Boy version was then ported to the3DS Virtual Console.",
