  "description": "TownShip Floating Citadel, Breath of Fire II (SNES). Breath of Fire II: The Fated Child(ブレス オブ ファイアII 使命の子,, Breath of Fire II: Shimei no Ko?)was originally released in Japan in 1994 and later localized asBreath of Fire II. It is arole-playing gamedeveloped and published byCapcom. First released in1994, the game was licensed to Laguna for European release in1996.",
