  "description_raw": "Breath of Fire II: The Fated Child(ブレス オブ ファイアII 使命の子,, Breath of Fire II: Shimei no Ko?)was originally released in Japan in 1994 and later localized asBreath of Fire II. It is arole-playing gamedeveloped and published byCapcom. First released in1994, the game was licensed to Laguna for European release in1996. It is the second entry in theBreath of Fireseries. It was later ported toGame Boy Advanceand re-released worldwide. The game has been rated by the ESRB for release onWii'sVirtual Console; Nintendo of Europe's website mistakenly announced it for release on July 27, 2007, but was released two weeks later on August 10, 2007. The game was released on theVirtual Consolein North America on August 27, 2007.",
