  "target": "Type III - Dimension Cataclysm Void",
  "url": "https://strategywiki.org/wiki/R-Type/Gameplay",
  "page_title": "R-Type/Gameplay",
  "section_count": 6,
  "description": "Type III - Dimension Cataclysm Void, R (SNES). There are a number of enhancements that the R-9a can employ, including increased speed, a missile system, and \"Bits\" which hover above and below the ship. Highly maneuverable, it has tremendous flight capability through space. But the most powerful weapon available to the R-9a is the Force, which is explained below.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Type III - Dimension Cataclysm Void' from R (SNES). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Type III - Dimension Cataclysm Void, R (SNES). There are a number of enhancements that the R-9a can employ, including increased speed, a missile system, and \"Bits\" which hover above and below the ship. Highly maneuverable, it has tremendous flight capability through space. But the most powerful weapon available to the R-9a is the Force, which is explained below. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "The R-9a is the craft that has been designated as the assault weapon to pit against the entire Bydo army. Highly maneuverable, it has tremendous flight capability through space. However, it's key design is it's upgradeable weapons system. When delivered into battle, it starts out in its weakest state. Throughout combat, the R-9a can utilize special energy signatures left behind by defeated enemies and convert them into powerful weapons. There are a number of enhancements that the R-9a can employ, including increased speed, a missile system, and \"Bits\" which hover above and below the ship. But the most powerful weapon available to the R-9a is the Force, which is explained below. In addition to the various enhancements, the R-9a comes equipped with a special Wave Beam attack which is performed by charging up fire power and releasing it at once in a large burst of energy. While charging, th",
  "brief": "Type III - Dimension Cataclysm Void, R (SNES). There are a number of enhancements that the R-9a can employ, including increased speed, a missile system, and \"Bits\" which hover above and below the ship. Highly maneuverable, it has tremendous flight capability through space. But the most powerful weapon available to the R-9a is the Force, which is explained below.",
