  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Bowser's Sky Fortress' from Tetris Attack (SNES). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Bowser's Sky Fortress, Tetris Attack (SNES). Unfortunately, the Game Boy Advance port is rather limited and does not include all of the features the earlier incarnations had. Tetris Attackis apuzzlegame released in1996, developed byIntelligent Systems(the famed studio behind theFamicom Warsseries). The most recent release isDr. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "Tetris Attackis apuzzlegame released in1996, developed byIntelligent Systems(the famed studio behind theFamicom Warsseries). However, it was merely a reskinned localization of the1995Japanese puzzlerPanel de Pon, as was the laterPokémon Puzzle League(and its Game Boy Color portPokémon Puzzle Challenge). The most recent release isDr. Mario and Puzzle League(Dr. Mario and Panel de Pon in Japan) for theGame Boy Advance, released in late2005. Unfortunately, the Game Boy Advance port is rather limited and does not include all of the features the earlier incarnations had. It is worth noting that in2002, Nintendo releasedNintendo Puzzle Collection, a Japan-only release, featuringPanel de PonamongstDr. MarioandYoshi's Cookie; a US release was planned, cancelled, and slowly faded into obscurity. This is the most advanced version of the game known to date, with support for up to four players (the ",
  "brief": "Bowser's Sky Fortress, Tetris Attack (SNES). Unfortunately, the Game Boy Advance port is rather limited and does not include all of the features the earlier incarnations had. Tetris Attackis apuzzlegame released in1996, developed byIntelligent Systems(the famed studio behind theFamicom Warsseries). The most recent release isDr.",
