  "description_raw": "Decap Attackis a westernized version of the Japanese gameMagical Hat no Buttobi Tabo! Daibōken, and is a video game for theSega Genesisconsole. In comparison to the Japanese title, the graphics, characters and levels designs were changed, since the license to the anime seriesFlying Turbo Adventurewas not obtained outside of Japan. It is included in theSega Genesis Collectionfor thePlayStation 2andSonic's Ultimate Genesis Collectionfor theXbox 360andPlayStation 3.",
