 {
  "id": 213,
  "platform": "Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800",
  "game": "Atlantis",
  "target": "Sunken Underwater Metropolis",
  "url": "https://strategywiki.org/wiki/Atlantis_no_Nazo/Walkthrough",
  "page_title": "Atlantis no Nazo/Walkthrough",
  "section_count": 96,
  "description": "Sunken Underwater Metropolis, Atlantis (Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800). From the starting point, head left and grab the treasure near the cliff for 500 points. Soon after that is the first already open door, which leads to Zone 2. The adventure starts.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Sunken Underwater Metropolis' from Atlantis (Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800). World brief: Sunken Underwater Metropolis, Atlantis (Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800). From the starting point, head left and grab the treasure near the cliff for 500 points. Soon after that is the first already open door, which leads to Zone 2. The adventure starts. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "The adventure starts. From the starting point, head left and grab the treasure near the cliff for 500 points. There is also a hidden warp to Zone 33, which is triggered by jumping off and hugging the edge of cliff while falling. Now go back to the right, avoiding the bats and their droppings, and there will be another treasure (100 points) along the way. Soon after that is the first already open door, which leads to Zone 2. Further to the right there will be another door to Zone 11, but it is locked and must be blown open with a bomb.",
  "brief": "Sunken Underwater Metropolis, Atlantis (Atari 2600 / 5200 / 7800). From the starting point, head left and grab the treasure near the cliff for 500 points. Soon after that is the first already open door, which leads to Zone 2. The adventure starts."
 },
