  "page_title": "Gun.Smoke",
  "section_count": 1,
  "description": "Wild West Dust Town & Mountain Pass, Gun.Smoke (NES). The game, which has an American Western theme, centers around a character named Billy Bob, a bounty hunter who is after vicious criminals of the Wild West. These obstacles do not cause damage to Billy even if he is caught between the screen and the obstacle (this will, however, kill the horse). Gun.Smokeis a vertical scrollingshooterarcadegame designed by Yoshiki Okamoto, and created byCapcomin 1985.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Wild West Dust Town & Mountain Pass' from Gun.Smoke (NES). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Wild West Dust Town & Mountain Pass, Gun.Smoke (NES). The game, which has an American Western theme, centers around a character named Billy Bob, a bounty hunter who is after vicious criminals of the Wild West. These obstacles do not cause damage to Billy even if he is caught between the screen and the obstacle (this will, however, kill the horse). Gun.Smokeis a vertical scrollingshooterarcadegame designed by Yoshiki Okamoto, and created byCapcomin 1985. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "Gun.Smokeis a vertical scrollingshooterarcadegame designed by Yoshiki Okamoto, and created byCapcomin 1985. The game, which has an American Western theme, centers around a character named Billy Bob, a bounty hunter who is after vicious criminals of the Wild West. Although sold by Capcom and purchased byRockstar, theRed Deadvideo game franchise started out as a spiritual successor toGun.Smoke. Gun.Smokeis very similar toCommando, another Capcom game, but with several differences. Whereas Commando is a \"run and gun\" game, this game is a scrolling shooter in which the screen scrolls upward automatically. Players have three ways to shoot, using three buttons for left, right, and center shooting. However, a player can combine buttons to change the angle at which the guns are fired. Players still die by getting shot or struck by enemies like in Commando, but can improve their chances by gettin",
  "brief": "Wild West Dust Town & Mountain Pass, Gun.Smoke (NES). The game, which has an American Western theme, centers around a character named Billy Bob, a bounty hunter who is after vicious criminals of the Wild West. These obstacles do not cause damage to Billy even if he is caught between the screen and the obstacle (this will, however, kill the horse). Gun.Smokeis a vertical scrollingshooterarcadegame designed by Yoshiki Okamoto, and created byCapcomin 1985.",
