  "target": "Ingested Intestinal Flesh Tunnel",
  "url": "https://strategywiki.org/wiki/Abadox/Gameplay",
  "page_title": "Abadox",
  "section_count": 3,
  "description": "Ingested Intestinal Flesh Tunnel, Abadox (NES). It is a horizontally scrollingshooterin the vein ofGradiusandR-Typetaking place inside the intestinal tract of a giant alien organism.Abadoxhas a high difficulty, and it takes one hit from an enemy projectile to be killed and restart from a checkpoint passed before death. Abadox: The Deadly Inner War(アバドックス,Abadokkusu?)is a game for theNESpublished in Japan in 1989 byNatsumeand North America in 1990 byMilton Bradley.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Ingested Intestinal Flesh Tunnel' from Abadox (NES). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Ingested Intestinal Flesh Tunnel, Abadox (NES). It is a horizontally scrollingshooterin the vein ofGradiusandR-Typetaking place inside the intestinal tract of a giant alien organism.Abadoxhas a high difficulty, and it takes one hit from an enemy projectile to be killed and restart from a checkpoint passed before death. Abadox: The Deadly Inner War(アバドックス,Abadokkusu?)is a game for theNESpublished in Japan in 1989 byNatsumeand North America in 1990 byMilton Bradley. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "Abadox: The Deadly Inner War(アバドックス,Abadokkusu?)is a game for theNESpublished in Japan in 1989 byNatsumeand North America in 1990 byMilton Bradley. It is a horizontally scrollingshooterin the vein ofGradiusandR-Typetaking place inside the intestinal tract of a giant alien organism.Abadoxhas a high difficulty, and it takes one hit from an enemy projectile to be killed and restart from a checkpoint passed before death. Abadox had an extensive TV commercial campaign, advertising the level of difficulty as a primary feature. The game received minimal press and mediocre reviews upon release, although the soundtrack was praised, mostly due to the involvement of Kyouhei Sada, a composer known for his work onKonamigames, such as theContra franchise.",
  "brief": "Ingested Intestinal Flesh Tunnel, Abadox (NES). It is a horizontally scrollingshooterin the vein ofGradiusandR-Typetaking place inside the intestinal tract of a giant alien organism.Abadoxhas a high difficulty, and it takes one hit from an enemy projectile to be killed and restart from a checkpoint passed before death. Abadox: The Deadly Inner War(アバドックス,Abadokkusu?)is a game for theNESpublished in Japan in 1989 byNatsumeand North America in 1990 byMilton Bradley.",
