  "page_title": "Burai Fighter",
  "section_count": 1,
  "description": "Deep Space Orbital Bases & Alien Nests, Burai Fighter (NES). Burai Fighteris a side-scrollingshootergame released for theNintendo Entertainment Systemin1990. It was later ported to theGame Boyhandheld system where it was titledBurai Fighter Deluxe. The goal of Burai Fighter is to fend off seven bases of Burai, super-intelligent cyborgs.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Deep Space Orbital Bases & Alien Nests' from Burai Fighter (NES). The attached reference image is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Deep Space Orbital Bases & Alien Nests, Burai Fighter (NES). Burai Fighteris a side-scrollingshootergame released for theNintendo Entertainment Systemin1990. It was later ported to theGame Boyhandheld system where it was titledBurai Fighter Deluxe. The goal of Burai Fighter is to fend off seven bases of Burai, super-intelligent cyborgs. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "Burai Fighteris a side-scrollingshootergame released for theNintendo Entertainment Systemin1990. It was later ported to theGame Boyhandheld system where it was titledBurai Fighter Deluxe. The goal of Burai Fighter is to fend off seven bases of Burai, super-intelligent cyborgs. The player starts out with a relatively weak cannon but can upgrade to ring, laser, and missile weapons, which are much more powerful. The player can also choose from three difficulty settings: Eagle, Albatross, and Ace; but the fourth difficulty setting, Ultimate, must be unlocked.",
  "brief": "Deep Space Orbital Bases & Alien Nests, Burai Fighter (NES). Burai Fighteris a side-scrollingshootergame released for theNintendo Entertainment Systemin1990. It was later ported to theGame Boyhandheld system where it was titledBurai Fighter Deluxe. The goal of Burai Fighter is to fend off seven bases of Burai, super-intelligent cyborgs.",
