  "platform": "NES",
  "game": "The Goonies II",
  "target": "Subterranean Caverns & Hidden Ice Vaults",
  "url": "https://strategywiki.org/wiki/The_Goonies_II/Gameplay",
  "page_title": "The Goonies II",
  "section_count": 5,
  "description": "Subterranean Caverns & Hidden Ice Vaults, The Goonies II (NES). The game also features a password system, allowing to resume play later with all of the items collected and Goonies previously rescued, but spawing at the game start location. The Goonies II(グーニーズ2 フラッテリー最後の挑戦,The Goonies II: Fratelli Saigo no Chousen?,The Goonies II: The Fratelli's Last Stand)is an adventure game developed and published byKonamifor theNES. The game's story centers on Mikey.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Subterranean Caverns & Hidden Ice Vaults' from The Goonies II (NES). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Subterranean Caverns & Hidden Ice Vaults, The Goonies II (NES). The game also features a password system, allowing to resume play later with all of the items collected and Goonies previously rescued, but spawing at the game start location. The Goonies II(グーニーズ2 フラッテリー最後の挑戦,The Goonies II: Fratelli Saigo no Chousen?,The Goonies II: The Fratelli's Last Stand)is an adventure game developed and published byKonamifor theNES. The game's story centers on Mikey. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "The Goonies II(グーニーズ2 フラッテリー最後の挑戦,The Goonies II: Fratelli Saigo no Chousen?,The Goonies II: The Fratelli's Last Stand)is an adventure game developed and published byKonamifor theNES. It was released on March 18, 1987 in Japan, November 1987 in North America, and on December 19, 1988 in Europe. It is a sequel to theGoonies, which was only released for the Famicom in Japan (although it was available is the US on PlayChoice-10 arcade units). Therefore, some believed it was supposed to be a tie-in to an unproduced sequel to the \"Goonies\" movie. The game's story centers on Mikey. His friends, the Goonies, have been kidnapped by the Fratellis—an Italian family of small-time crooks and counterfeiters. Mikey must rescue all six of his friends and, inexplicably, free a captured mermaid named Annie. Unlike the first Goonies game, The Goonies II is not a linear game. The player is free to explore ",
  "brief": "Subterranean Caverns & Hidden Ice Vaults, The Goonies II (NES). The game also features a password system, allowing to resume play later with all of the items collected and Goonies previously rescued, but spawing at the game start location. The Goonies II(グーニーズ2 フラッテリー最後の挑戦,The Goonies II: Fratelli Saigo no Chousen?,The Goonies II: The Fratelli's Last Stand)is an adventure game developed and published byKonamifor theNES. The game's story centers on Mikey.",
