  "description": "Junk Man's Scrapyard & Shade Man's Castle, Mega Man 7 (SNES). Mega Man 7was originally released in Japan asRockman 7: Fated Confrontation!(ロックマン7 宿命の対決!,Rockman 7 shukumei no taiketsu!?). It's the 7th game in theMega Man series, which originally appeared on theSNESand then later was bundled withinMega Man Anniversary Collectionfor theGameCube,PS2, andXbox. In2014it was made available for theWii U Virtual Consolevia theNintendo eShop.",
