  "page_title": "The Magical Quest Starring Mickey Mouse",
  "section_count": 2,
  "description": "Treetop Vine Village, The Magical Quest Starring Mickey Mouse (SNES). The Magical Quest Starring Mickey Mouseis a platformer video game developed and published byCapcom, it is the first game in the series, was released for theSuper Nintendo Entertainment Systemduring1992and1993and later re-released for theGame Boy Advancein2002. The game, and especially its outfit system and graphics, received mostly positive reviews, but was criticized for being relatively short.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Treetop Vine Village' from The Magical Quest Starring Mickey Mouse (SNES). The attached reference image is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Treetop Vine Village, The Magical Quest Starring Mickey Mouse (SNES). The Magical Quest Starring Mickey Mouseis a platformer video game developed and published byCapcom, it is the first game in the series, was released for theSuper Nintendo Entertainment Systemduring1992and1993and later re-released for theGame Boy Advancein2002. The game, and especially its outfit system and graphics, received mostly positive reviews, but was criticized for being relatively short. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "The Magical Quest Starring Mickey Mouseis a platformer video game developed and published byCapcom, it is the first game in the series, was released for theSuper Nintendo Entertainment Systemduring1992and1993and later re-released for theGame Boy Advancein2002. Featuring six different levels with four different special outfits it stars Mickey Mouse on his journey to save his dog Pluto, who was dognapped by the emperor Pete during a game of catch with his friends Donald Duck and Goofy. The game, and especially its outfit system and graphics, received mostly positive reviews, but was criticized for being relatively short. A port was originally planned for the Sega Mega Drive, but was abandoned.",
  "brief": "Treetop Vine Village, The Magical Quest Starring Mickey Mouse (SNES). The Magical Quest Starring Mickey Mouseis a platformer video game developed and published byCapcom, it is the first game in the series, was released for theSuper Nintendo Entertainment Systemduring1992and1993and later re-released for theGame Boy Advancein2002. The game, and especially its outfit system and graphics, received mostly positive reviews, but was criticized for being relatively short.",
