  "description": "Cyber-Feudal Fortresses & Airships, Hagane: The Final Conflict (SNES). Hagane: The Final Conflictis a side-scrollingactiongame released for theSNESin 1994. It concerns the story of a cybernetic ninja, with the mission to stop a rival clan from destroying the world and retrieving the artifact they intend to use. It plays similarly to other arcade action games, requiring play to start at the beginning of the game.",
