  "description": "Ruined Genetic Laboratories, The Peace Keepers (SNES). The manual of the North American release details the localized story. The game takes place in the year 2015, after the \"economic wars\" of 2011. The Deutschland Moldavia (DM) corporation rules most of the world and its resources, conducting mysterious genetic experiments.",
