  "page_title": "Rival Turf!",
  "section_count": 3,
  "description": "Downtown City Docks & Stadium Arena, Rival Turf! (SNES). Jack Flak's girlfriend Heather has been kidnapped by Big Al and his gang the Street Kings. He enlists the help of his friend, police officer Oswald \"Oozie\" Nelson to rescue his girlfriend and rid the city from the reign of the Street Kings once and for all. They start out by heading to the sports stadium to find out more information and locate Big Al's hideout.",
