  "game": "Romancing SaGa 3",
  "target": "Sunken Holy King Towers",
  "url": "https://strategywiki.org/wiki/Romancing_SaGa_3",
  "page_title": "Romancing SaGa 3",
  "section_count": 2,
  "description": "Sunken Holy King Towers, Romancing SaGa 3 (SNES). Romancing SaGa 3(ロマンシング サ・ガ3,Romanshingu SaGa Surī?)is arole-playing video gamedeveloped and published bySquarein1995, released for theSuper Famicomhome console. It is the sixth mainline entry in theSaGaseries, and the last in the Romancing SaGa trilogy. The game was ported to the Virtual Console forWiiandWii Uin2010and2014respectively, but remained Japan-exclusive.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Sunken Holy King Towers' from Romancing SaGa 3 (SNES). World brief: Sunken Holy King Towers, Romancing SaGa 3 (SNES). Romancing SaGa 3(ロマンシング サ・ガ3,Romanshingu SaGa Surī?)is arole-playing video gamedeveloped and published bySquarein1995, released for theSuper Famicomhome console. It is the sixth mainline entry in theSaGaseries, and the last in the Romancing SaGa trilogy. The game was ported to the Virtual Console forWiiandWii Uin2010and2014respectively, but remained Japan-exclusive. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "Romancing SaGa 3(ロマンシング サ・ガ3,Romanshingu SaGa Surī?)is arole-playing video gamedeveloped and published bySquarein1995, released for theSuper Famicomhome console. It is the sixth mainline entry in theSaGaseries, and the last in the Romancing SaGa trilogy. The game was ported to the Virtual Console forWiiandWii Uin2010and2014respectively, but remained Japan-exclusive. In2019, a remastered version was released worldwide forPlayStation Vita,iOS, andAndroid,PlayStation 4,Nintendo Switch,Xbox One, andWindows. A remake titledRomancing SaGa 3: Destinies Unitedis set to be released in 2027.",
  "brief": "Sunken Holy King Towers, Romancing SaGa 3 (SNES). Romancing SaGa 3(ロマンシング サ・ガ3,Romanshingu SaGa Surī?)is arole-playing video gamedeveloped and published bySquarein1995, released for theSuper Famicomhome console. It is the sixth mainline entry in theSaGaseries, and the last in the Romancing SaGa trilogy. The game was ported to the Virtual Console forWiiandWii Uin2010and2014respectively, but remained Japan-exclusive."
 },
