 {
  "id": 319,
  "platform": "SNES",
  "game": "Lufia & the Fortress of Doom",
  "target": "Floating Island Doom Fortress",
  "url": "https://strategywiki.org/wiki/Lufia_%26_the_Fortress_of_Doom",
  "page_title": "Lufia & the Fortress of Doom",
  "section_count": 3,
  "description": "Floating Island Doom Fortress, Lufia & the Fortress of Doom (SNES). The story ofLufia & the Fortress of Doombegins, in accordance with an ancient prophecy of the Lufia world, with a massive floating island with a large castle located on it emerging into the sky one dark day. Unable to teleport them to safety, Artea and Guy leave the falling island alone, and their trapped allies apparently perish when it crashes into the earth below.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Floating Island Doom Fortress' from Lufia & the Fortress of Doom (SNES). World brief: Floating Island Doom Fortress, Lufia & the Fortress of Doom (SNES). The story ofLufia & the Fortress of Doombegins, in accordance with an ancient prophecy of the Lufia world, with a massive floating island with a large castle located on it emerging into the sky one dark day. Unable to teleport them to safety, Artea and Guy leave the falling island alone, and their trapped allies apparently perish when it crashes into the earth below. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "The story ofLufia & the Fortress of Doombegins, in accordance with an ancient prophecy of the Lufia world, with a massive floating island with a large castle located on it emerging into the sky one dark day. Dubbed the \"Fortress of Doom\", this castle served as the base of operations for a group of all-powerful beings known as the Sinistrals, who planned to use their strength to bring the world to its knees. In response, the people sent four of their bravest warriors: Maxim, Selan, Artea, and Guy, to infiltrate the dark fortress and destroy the Sinistrals before they could do any harm. The game begins with the player controlling these characters as they prepare to engage the Sinistrals, and eventually defeat them. However, after the battle, the fortress begins to collapse, with Maxim and Selan becoming trapped on the other side of a deep chasm that forms when the Sinistral throne room spl",
  "brief": "Floating Island Doom Fortress, Lufia & the Fortress of Doom (SNES). The story ofLufia & the Fortress of Doombegins, in accordance with an ancient prophecy of the Lufia world, with a massive floating island with a large castle located on it emerging into the sky one dark day. Unable to teleport them to safety, Artea and Guy leave the falling island alone, and their trapped allies apparently perish when it crashes into the earth below."
 },
