  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Gritty Dystopian Seattle Morgue & Wasteland' from Shadowrun (SNES). The attached reference image is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Gritty Dystopian Seattle Morgue & Wasteland, Shadowrun (SNES). TheGenesis Shadowrunalso references it through a character named \"Nero Manser\". This is the first game in theShadowrunseries. For other games in the series see theShadowrun category. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "This is the first game in theShadowrunseries. For other games in the series see theShadowrun category. You are Jake Armitage, a shadowrunner. You were unceremoniously executed in the streets, but somehow you woke up in the morgue (albeit with a massive migraine). Somebody wants you dead, and you have to find out who, and why. The name \"Armitage\" is a reference to William Gibson'sNeuromancer, the first cyberpunk novel. TheGenesis Shadowrunalso references it through a character named \"Nero Manser\".",
