  "page_title": "Truxton",
  "section_count": 2,
  "description": "Dark Space Asteroid Weapon Installations, Truxton (Tatsujin) (Sega Genesis / Master System / Game Gear). Taking place somewhere in space, an armada of Gidans led by the evil Dogurava is invading the fictional planet Borogo aboard five gargantuan asteroids. After surviving an attack on an orbiting Borogo cargo barge, a pilot named Tatsuo enters into one remaining ship called Super Fighter and challenges the Gidans in a desperate attempt to quell the alien invasion and divert their asteroid fortresses in the process.",
