 {
  "id": 375,
  "platform": "Sega Genesis / Master System / Game Gear",
  "game": "Valis III",
  "target": "Dark Underworld Bastions & Dimensional Gates",
  "url": "https://strategywiki.org/wiki/Valis_III",
  "page_title": "Valis III",
  "section_count": 2,
  "description": "Dark Underworld Bastions & Dimensional Gates, Valis III (Sega Genesis / Master System / Game Gear). King Glames leads denizens of the Dark World to conquer both Earth and Vecanti. He seeks a home for his people before the destruction of his planet. Against this common foe, Yuko Asou will fight together with Cham, a Dark World warrior-maiden who was a demon born in the Dark World and uses a deadly whip, and her own sister Valna Asou, who grew up within Vecanti and became strong in the ways of magic.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Dark Underworld Bastions & Dimensional Gates' from Valis III (Sega Genesis / Master System / Game Gear). The attached reference image is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Dark Underworld Bastions & Dimensional Gates, Valis III (Sega Genesis / Master System / Game Gear). King Glames leads denizens of the Dark World to conquer both Earth and Vecanti. He seeks a home for his people before the destruction of his planet. Against this common foe, Yuko Asou will fight together with Cham, a Dark World warrior-maiden who was a demon born in the Dark World and uses a deadly whip, and her own sister Valna Asou, who grew up within Vecanti and became strong in the ways of magic. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "King Glames leads denizens of the Dark World to conquer both Earth and Vecanti. He seeks a home for his people before the destruction of his planet. Against this common foe, Yuko Asou will fight together with Cham, a Dark World warrior-maiden who was a demon born in the Dark World and uses a deadly whip, and her own sister Valna Asou, who grew up within Vecanti and became strong in the ways of magic. Furthermore, the Valis sword is shown to be capable of more than what Yuko has accomplished with it thus far. During the course of the game, Yuko rescues the kidnapped Cham and Valna from captivity. A visit to the ruler of Vecanti, Nizetti, unleashes the blade's full potential, which culminates in a climactic battle between the three girls and Glames as well the returning antagonist from the first game, Rogmes. The Valis warrior defeats them both, and for her dutiful and unwavering service, ",
  "brief": "Dark Underworld Bastions & Dimensional Gates, Valis III (Sega Genesis / Master System / Game Gear). King Glames leads denizens of the Dark World to conquer both Earth and Vecanti. He seeks a home for his people before the destruction of his planet. Against this common foe, Yuko Asou will fight together with Cham, a Dark World warrior-maiden who was a demon born in the Dark World and uses a deadly whip, and her own sister Valna Asou, who grew up within Vecanti and became strong in the ways of magic.",
  "image_url": null,
