  "url": "https://strategywiki.org/wiki/Vampire_Savior/Walkthrough",
  "page_title": "Vampire Savior",
  "section_count": 0,
  "description": "Fetus of God Organic Cathedral, Vampire Savior (Arcade). The third and final proper installment in the series,Vampire Savior: Lord of Vampire, retained the character roster of Night Warriors, omitting Donovan, Huitzil and Pyron from the lineup. Taking their place were four new characters; Jedah, Lilith, Q-Bee and B. In Vampire Savior, Jedah, one of the high nobles of Makai, is resurrected after a premature death long ago.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Fetus of God Organic Cathedral' from Vampire Savior (Arcade). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Fetus of God Organic Cathedral, Vampire Savior (Arcade). The third and final proper installment in the series,Vampire Savior: Lord of Vampire, retained the character roster of Night Warriors, omitting Donovan, Huitzil and Pyron from the lineup. Taking their place were four new characters; Jedah, Lilith, Q-Bee and B. In Vampire Savior, Jedah, one of the high nobles of Makai, is resurrected after a premature death long ago. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "The third and final proper installment in the series,Vampire Savior: Lord of Vampire, retained the character roster of Night Warriors, omitting Donovan, Huitzil and Pyron from the lineup. Taking their place were four new characters; Jedah, Lilith, Q-Bee and B. B. Hood. Vampire Savior eschews the traditional round-based system in favour of what is dubbed Damage Gauge System; instead battles takes place during a period of one round with each fighter having two \"life markers\" (by default) which are diminish after one's life bar is completely emptied (similar to Killer Instinct). The player can also regain a portion of their life during battle if they avoid taking further hits. The game also introduce the Dark Force System which allow players to perform special abilities unique to each character for a limited period. In Vampire Savior, Jedah, one of the high nobles of Makai, is resurrected a",
  "brief": "Fetus of God Organic Cathedral, Vampire Savior (Arcade). The third and final proper installment in the series,Vampire Savior: Lord of Vampire, retained the character roster of Night Warriors, omitting Donovan, Huitzil and Pyron from the lineup. Taking their place were four new characters; Jedah, Lilith, Q-Bee and B. In Vampire Savior, Jedah, one of the high nobles of Makai, is resurrected after a premature death long ago.",
