  "page_title": "Dungeons & Dragons: Tower of Doom",
  "section_count": 1,
  "description": "Cursed Dragon Crypts, Dungeons & Dragons: Tower of Doom (Arcade). Unlike their usualbeat 'em ups, Tower of Doom features role-playing and adventure elements including gold, shops, spells, item equipping and more. Dungeons & Dragons: Tower of Doomis the first of twoDungeons & Dragonsarcadegames produced byCapcom.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Cursed Dragon Crypts' from Dungeons & Dragons: Tower of Doom (Arcade). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Cursed Dragon Crypts, Dungeons & Dragons: Tower of Doom (Arcade). Unlike their usualbeat 'em ups, Tower of Doom features role-playing and adventure elements including gold, shops, spells, item equipping and more. Dungeons & Dragons: Tower of Doomis the first of twoDungeons & Dragonsarcadegames produced byCapcom. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "Dungeons & Dragons: Tower of Doomis the first of twoDungeons & Dragonsarcadegames produced byCapcom. Unlike their usualbeat 'em ups, Tower of Doom features role-playing and adventure elements including gold, shops, spells, item equipping and more. Rather than a simple magic or special button likeGolden AxeorKnights of the Round, Capcom also added a Select button for choosing spells and items at will, rather than having one automatically selected. There is a greater emphasis on weapon-based attacks rather than grabs and throws, and there are no desperation attacks unlike in most Capcom beat-'em-ups (usually executed by pressing attack and jump together).",
  "brief": "Cursed Dragon Crypts, Dungeons & Dragons: Tower of Doom (Arcade). Unlike their usualbeat 'em ups, Tower of Doom features role-playing and adventure elements including gold, shops, spells, item equipping and more. Dungeons & Dragons: Tower of Doomis the first of twoDungeons & Dragonsarcadegames produced byCapcom.",
