  "section_count": 1,
  "description": "Airport Runways & Burning Buildings, Shadow Dancer (Arcade) (More Arcade). Shadow Dancer: The Secret of Shinobihas five levels. The final screen of every level is the boss. II is exactly the same as Shadow Dancer I except that each boss must be hiteighttimes.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Airport Runways & Burning Buildings' from Shadow Dancer (Arcade) (More Arcade). World brief: Airport Runways & Burning Buildings, Shadow Dancer (Arcade) (More Arcade). Shadow Dancer: The Secret of Shinobihas five levels. The final screen of every level is the boss. II is exactly the same as Shadow Dancer I except that each boss must be hiteighttimes. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "Shadow Dancer: The Secret of Shinobihas five levels. The final screen of every level is the boss. You must hit each boss six times to defeat him. You fight the boss on the third screen of the first four levels, the fifth screen for level five. The game then continues to Shadow Dancer II when you defeat the final boss. II is exactly the same as Shadow Dancer I except that each boss must be hiteighttimes. The game then continues to Shadow Dancer III when you defeat the final boss. III is exactly the same as Shadow Dancer II except that each boss must be hittentimes.",
  "brief": "Airport Runways & Burning Buildings, Shadow Dancer (Arcade) (More Arcade). Shadow Dancer: The Secret of Shinobihas five levels. The final screen of every level is the boss. II is exactly the same as Shadow Dancer I except that each boss must be hiteighttimes."
