  "description": "Dead End Docks & Meatpacking Plants, Vendetta (More Arcade). These terrorists have made impossible demands and have threatened to detonate the device within an hour if they are not met. Vendettais aBeat 'em upgame released in1989bySystem 3. The protagonist is a mercenary that discovers that an inventor of a suitcase-sized nuclear device and his daughter were kidnapped by terrorists.",
