  "description_raw": "Vendettais aBeat 'em upgame released in1989bySystem 3. The protagonist is a mercenary that discovers that an inventor of a suitcase-sized nuclear device and his daughter were kidnapped by terrorists. These terrorists have made impossible demands and have threatened to detonate the device within an hour if they are not met. The game has bothadventureandbeat 'em upcomponents. To progress through the game, you need to head into the many rooms collecting both pieces of evidence and other items that you will need. The player is given one hour to finish all seven stages to complete the game.",
