  "section_count": 1,
  "description": "Enemy Base Outposts & Spire, Bionic Commando (Arcade) (More Arcade). The arcade version of Bionic Commando is a linear action game.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Enemy Base Outposts & Spire' from Bionic Commando (Arcade) (More Arcade). World brief: Enemy Base Outposts & Spire, Bionic Commando (Arcade) (More Arcade). The arcade version of Bionic Commando is a linear action game. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "The arcade version of Bionic Commando is a linear action game. You must complete five stages and you must complete them in the same order every time. Generally speaking, your goal in each stage is to start somewhere in the lower left corner of the stage, and climb your way to the upper right, although each stage varies in composition. In the first two stages, you are only required to reach the end of the stage in order to advance to the next stage. However, in the latter three stages, you must also defeat certain members of the enemy force with higher rank before you can proceed. The stages that you must complete are as follows:",
  "brief": "Enemy Base Outposts & Spire, Bionic Commando (Arcade) (More Arcade). The arcade version of Bionic Commando is a linear action game."
 },
 {
