  "description": "NYC Streets, Sewers & Technodrome, Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles (1989 Arcade) (More Arcade). In general, reserve Donatello for important fights, and use the other turtles to travel from one location to another.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'NYC Streets, Sewers & Technodrome' from Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles (1989 Arcade) (More Arcade). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: NYC Streets, Sewers & Technodrome, Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles (1989 Arcade) (More Arcade). In general, reserve Donatello for important fights, and use the other turtles to travel from one location to another. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "While walking around outside, you face two dangers; foot solders and steam rollers. The foot soldiers outside are easily dispatched with a single strike from your weapon. On the other hand, the steam rollers will flatten you in an instant no matter how much health you have, so steer very clear of them. In general, reserve Donatello for important fights, and use the other turtles to travel from one location to another.",
