  "page_title": "Altered Beast",
  "section_count": 2,
  "description": "Greco-Roman Underworld Tombs & Rotting Wastelands, Altered Beast (More Arcade). The Warrior is ordered by Zeus to save his daughter Athena from a Demon God called Neff in the Underworld. To become able to withstand the perils, the warrior is given the ability to collect three spirit balls on each level, the last of which transforms him into a human/beast hybrid of formidable power.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Greco-Roman Underworld Tombs & Rotting Wastelands' from Altered Beast (More Arcade). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Greco-Roman Underworld Tombs & Rotting Wastelands, Altered Beast (More Arcade). The Warrior is ordered by Zeus to save his daughter Athena from a Demon God called Neff in the Underworld. To become able to withstand the perils, the warrior is given the ability to collect three spirit balls on each level, the last of which transforms him into a human/beast hybrid of formidable power. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "The game is set in Ancient Greece, and follows a centurion who is resurrected by Zeus to rescue his daughter Athena. The Warrior is ordered by Zeus to save his daughter Athena from a Demon God called Neff in the Underworld. To become able to withstand the perils, the warrior is given the ability to collect three spirit balls on each level, the last of which transforms him into a human/beast hybrid of formidable power.",
  "brief": "Greco-Roman Underworld Tombs & Rotting Wastelands, Altered Beast (More Arcade). The Warrior is ordered by Zeus to save his daughter Athena from a Demon God called Neff in the Underworld. To become able to withstand the perils, the warrior is given the ability to collect three spirit balls on each level, the last of which transforms him into a human/beast hybrid of formidable power.",
