  "target": "On - Continental GP Circuits & Desert Tracks",
  "url": "https://strategywiki.org/wiki/Super_Hang-On/Gameplay",
  "page_title": "Super Hang-On/Gameplay",
  "section_count": 2,
  "description": "On - Continental GP Circuits & Desert Tracks, Super Hang (More Arcade). The arcade mode in Super Hang-On is similar to the original Hang-On. However, there is a choice of four tracks to race on which are based on continents, each containing a different amount of stages. Each stage is roughly half the length of a stage in the original Hang-On.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'On - Continental GP Circuits & Desert Tracks' from Super Hang (More Arcade). World brief: On - Continental GP Circuits & Desert Tracks, Super Hang (More Arcade). The arcade mode in Super Hang-On is similar to the original Hang-On. However, there is a choice of four tracks to race on which are based on continents, each containing a different amount of stages. Each stage is roughly half the length of a stage in the original Hang-On. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "The arcade mode in Super Hang-On is similar to the original Hang-On. However, there is a choice of four tracks to race on which are based on continents, each containing a different amount of stages. Each stage is roughly half the length of a stage in the original Hang-On. When the player starts a race, they have their choice of four songs that will play during the race, a feature borrowed fromOut Run.",
  "brief": "On - Continental GP Circuits & Desert Tracks, Super Hang (More Arcade). The arcade mode in Super Hang-On is similar to the original Hang-On. However, there is a choice of four tracks to race on which are based on continents, each containing a different amount of stages. Each stage is roughly half the length of a stage in the original Hang-On."
