 {
  "id": 507,
  "platform": "NES / Famicom",
  "game": "Mega Man 2",
  "target": "Heat Man Magma Blocks & Air Man Clouds",
  "url": "https://strategywiki.org/wiki/Mega_Man_2/Gameplay",
  "page_title": "Mega Man 2/Heat Man",
  "section_count": 4,
  "description": "Heat Man Magma Blocks & Air Man Clouds, Mega Man 2 (NES / Famicom). As soon as he stands back up, turn around and immediately hit him before he has a chance to use his weapon. UsingFire Manas a basis, Dr. Wily created Heat Man to resemble a lighter.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Heat Man Magma Blocks & Air Man Clouds' from Mega Man 2 (NES / Famicom). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Heat Man Magma Blocks & Air Man Clouds, Mega Man 2 (NES / Famicom). As soon as he stands back up, turn around and immediately hit him before he has a chance to use his weapon. UsingFire Manas a basis, Dr. Wily created Heat Man to resemble a lighter. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "UsingFire Manas a basis, Dr. Wily created Heat Man to resemble a lighter. His weapon shoots condensed balls of flame that explode into pillars of fire upon hitting the ground. He can cloak himself in fire to make his body tackle attack even more destructive. Even if you don't know (or don't have access to) Heat Man's weakness, he is actually very predictable, and can be easily defeated with the Mega Buster. Whenever Heat Man is shot, he pauses briefly, and then flies across the ground to the location where you were standing. Once you hit him, prepare to jump over him as he flies over. As soon as he stands back up, turn around and immediately hit him before he has a chance to use his weapon. After you do, run as far away from him as you can. He will react, and then fly over the ground again, at which time you should jump over him and repeat the process until he is defeated. If possible, u",
  "brief": "Heat Man Magma Blocks & Air Man Clouds, Mega Man 2 (NES / Famicom). As soon as he stands back up, turn around and immediately hit him before he has a chance to use his weapon. UsingFire Manas a basis, Dr. Wily created Heat Man to resemble a lighter.",
  "image_url": "https://cdn.wikimg.net/en/strategywiki/images/6/6a/Mega_Man_2_map_Heat_Man_E.png",
