 {
  "id": 508,
  "platform": "NES / Famicom",
  "game": "Mega Man 3",
  "target": "Gemini Man Crystals & Snake Man Columns",
  "url": "https://strategywiki.org/wiki/Mega_Man_3/Doc_Man_in_Gemini_stage",
  "page_title": "Mega Man 3/Gemini Man",
  "section_count": 5,
  "description": "Gemini Man Crystals & Snake Man Columns, Mega Man 3 (NES / Famicom). \"Gemini\" is Latin for \"twins\", and appropriately he'll start the fight by splitting in two. Dodge their shots, learn the pattern, and fire away. When Geminiman's energy drops to 50%, he'll become one again, and begin using lasers that bounce off the walls.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Gemini Man Crystals & Snake Man Columns' from Mega Man 3 (NES / Famicom). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Gemini Man Crystals & Snake Man Columns, Mega Man 3 (NES / Famicom). \"Gemini\" is Latin for \"twins\", and appropriately he'll start the fight by splitting in two. Dodge their shots, learn the pattern, and fire away. When Geminiman's energy drops to 50%, he'll become one again, and begin using lasers that bounce off the walls. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "\"Gemini\" is Latin for \"twins\", and appropriately he'll start the fight by splitting in two. The two men will circle the arena in a predictable pattern, firing only when you fire. Dodge their shots, learn the pattern, and fire away. When Geminiman's energy drops to 50%, he'll become one again, and begin using lasers that bounce off the walls. These are slow-moving and not too tough to avoid. Just stay on your toes and you'll be victorious. The key to success here is theSearch Snake. With these in hand, you'll blow Gemini Man away in no time flat.",
  "brief": "Gemini Man Crystals & Snake Man Columns, Mega Man 3 (NES / Famicom). \"Gemini\" is Latin for \"twins\", and appropriately he'll start the fight by splitting in two. Dodge their shots, learn the pattern, and fire away. When Geminiman's energy drops to 50%, he'll become one again, and begin using lasers that bounce off the walls.",
  "image_url": "https://cdn.wikimg.net/en/strategywiki/images/1/1e/Megaman3WW_stage07_geminiman.png",
  "image_kind": "screenshot",
