  "target": "Plant Man Jungles & Blizzard Man Glaciers",
  "url": "https://strategywiki.org/wiki/Mega_Man_6",
  "page_title": "Mega Man 6/Plant Man",
  "section_count": 1,
  "description": "Plant Man Jungles & Blizzard Man Glaciers, Mega Man 6 (NES / Famicom). Plant Man is not a hard boss. His patterns are very similar to those of Star Man, and he's even easier.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Plant Man Jungles & Blizzard Man Glaciers' from Mega Man 6 (NES / Famicom). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Plant Man Jungles & Blizzard Man Glaciers, Mega Man 6 (NES / Famicom). Plant Man is not a hard boss. His patterns are very similar to those of Star Man, and he's even easier. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "Plant Man is not a hard boss. His patterns are very similar to those of Star Man, and he's even easier. He'll put on his shield, do a jump, and throw the shield at you and run forward, repeating this for the entire battle. He's only vulnerable when he's without the shield, so when he throws it, jump over and either use charged Mega Buster shots if this is your first stage, or stop him with extreme cold from the Blizzard Attack. Victory gets you Plant Barrier, and the Rush Jet Adaptor.",
  "brief": "Plant Man Jungles & Blizzard Man Glaciers, Mega Man 6 (NES / Famicom). Plant Man is not a hard boss. His patterns are very similar to those of Star Man, and he's even easier.",
