  "page_title": "Bionic Commando (NES)",
  "section_count": 1,
  "description": "Enemy Radar Bunkers & Imperial Citadels, Bionic Commando (NES) (NES / Famicom). This is the first game in theBionic Commandoseries. For other games in the series see theBionic Commando category. Bionic Commando, originally released in Japan asHitler no Fukkatsu: Top Secret(ヒットラーの復活 トップシークレット,Hitler no Fukkatsu: Top Secret?), is an action-adventure game released byCapcomfor theNESin1988.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Enemy Radar Bunkers & Imperial Citadels' from Bionic Commando (NES) (NES / Famicom). The attached reference imagery is the primary guide: match its layout, landmarks, colors and mood. World brief: Enemy Radar Bunkers & Imperial Citadels, Bionic Commando (NES) (NES / Famicom). This is the first game in theBionic Commandoseries. For other games in the series see theBionic Commando category. Bionic Commando, originally released in Japan asHitler no Fukkatsu: Top Secret(ヒットラーの復活 トップシークレット,Hitler no Fukkatsu: Top Secret?), is an action-adventure game released byCapcomfor theNESin1988. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
  "description_raw": "This is the first game in theBionic Commandoseries. For other games in the series see theBionic Commando category. Bionic Commando, originally released in Japan asHitler no Fukkatsu: Top Secret(ヒットラーの復活 トップシークレット,Hitler no Fukkatsu: Top Secret?), is an action-adventure game released byCapcomfor theNESin1988. It is the sequel of the 1987 arcade gameBionic Commando, originally released in Japan asTop Secret. Two enhanced remakes were released for theGame Boyin 1992 and then forPlaystation 3andXbox 360in 2008 (Bionic Commando Rearmed). A sequel,Bionic Commando: Elite Forces, was released for theGame Boy Color. It is also included inCapcom Classics Mini Mix. Some of the sounds used in the game were copied fromMega Man.",
  "brief": "Enemy Radar Bunkers & Imperial Citadels, Bionic Commando (NES) (NES / Famicom). This is the first game in theBionic Commandoseries. For other games in the series see theBionic Commando category. Bionic Commando, originally released in Japan asHitler no Fukkatsu: Top Secret(ヒットラーの復活 トップシークレット,Hitler no Fukkatsu: Top Secret?), is an action-adventure game released byCapcomfor theNESin1988.",
