  "description": "Kitchen Pantries, Toy Stores & Casino, Chip 'n Dale Rescue Rangers (NES / Famicom). Chip 'n Dale Rescue Rangersis a platform game developed and published by Capcom for the NES. It was released in North America and Japan in 1990 and in Europe in 1991.",
  "qwen_prompt": "Generate a fully interactive 3D WebGL Three.js world representing 'Kitchen Pantries, Toy Stores & Casino' from Chip 'n Dale Rescue Rangers (NES / Famicom). World brief: Kitchen Pantries, Toy Stores & Casino, Chip 'n Dale Rescue Rangers (NES / Famicom). Chip 'n Dale Rescue Rangersis a platform game developed and published by Capcom for the NES. It was released in North America and Japan in 1990 and in Europe in 1991. Include lighting, fog, textures/materials, animated environmental elements, and mouse/touch orbit camera controls.",
