  "description": "Sewer Flumes & Clockwork Towers, Chip 'n Dale Rescue Rangers 2 (NES / Famicom). Chip 'n Dale Rescue Rangers 2is a1993platform game developed and published byCapcomfor theNES. It was released in Japan in December 1993, in North America in January 1994 and in Europe in September 1994. It was one of the last games developed for the NES.",
